7">如同流星一般陨落消逝</text><text for="line-882d77f7-a724-44b0-a2af-b522d2418281">如今说不定已经传达到了</text><text for="line-3d3c30a5-0b75-41a5-a25f-942cbbc445fb">那就算伸出了手也</text><text for="line-a1c749c3-e17f-4996-a69f-59801a55b666">做不到那种事</text><text for="line-febbcc69-bea2-4498-9861-31ae29eacfa6">我只能静静地等待</text><text for="line-3768d6b4-fb14-448f-bf69-a703e98d24c4">一万的轨迹</text><text for="line-10708afb-e53c-49fb-bbc8-98aacd3f0c9d">不会放弃那份坚强</text><text for="line-c3530562-640b-4f98-9dea-c61c9f358b33">用那胆怯的脚前进吧</text><text for="line-1094cfaf-d509-4684-a8c1-aafe529a6cad">焦急</text><text for="line-174da06b-a652-4a36-9f1b-8d739a8f4606">后悔</text><text for="line-d175aa87-955e-496d-b460-5eff6f9a5417">才会向前而行</text><text for="line-8afa9520-f8f9-4083-b6cb-2d273069d8d2">这就是人啊</text><text for="line-190108dd-97b5-4a30-bc03-1fbc171e0300">60亿分的思念</text><text for="line-12df13f2-977d-471b-b81c-ef6eb35b0fbc">所编制而成的世界就在眼前</text><text for="line-4e87510c-2a34-4929-bc01-35cf379d5c22">将我们包围</text><text for="line-32f5d8a0-d88f-47e7-8fb9-93799cc5809e">听到传来了的声音</text><text for="line-3ba8d406-37c6-417a-955c-0fc77f85f36a">就算丑陋不堪也要活下去</text><text for="line-46ed4d98-aaae-4347-99a3-f612cd0be1bc">活下去才能守护</text><text for="line-527dce3f-c5b7-4f1d-84e9-16a2e9571171">就算丑陋不堪也要活下去</text><text for="line-cffd81cb-9eb3-4fc4-89b0-b3e8253a6afe">活下去就会迸发出光辉</text><text for="line-7f1eb8bd-42e8-40a0-827c-b2ea35acc814">旅途的记忆已经……</text><text for="line-63f5c5b5-eb01-412a-8f3a-fc14a325d738">遥远的岸边的早上</text><text for="line-1e08557d-f722-4410-a89d-b9717180cffe">现在，把你捧起</text><text for="line-50aa0fa8-96b9-4002-b3a4-fc1041c9b423">不会放弃那份坚强</text><text for="line-407a788e-92be-4e38-9b4a-0212b128547b">用那胆怯的脚前进吧</text><text for="line-f7dfad2c-f3ef-4be5-8fab-3d57391d2fd5">就算受伤</text><text for="line-561d5498-6cdf-4ade-a880-4b7fc3b0dff5">就算被风雨吹打</text><text for="line-cc4d147c-6423-42ee-8a45-faa6745c98e4">依然前行</text><text for="line-1b0a00cd-29f8-4889-983a-a97103f0198b">这就是人啊</text><text for="line-489bbca5-2a55-472c-a7b6-626a2e3e2bdb">60亿分的思念</text><text for="line-4dcb1c81-58fd-483c-89c7-a9350c900502">所编制而成的世界就在眼前</text><text for="line-fd55a8a5-1d8c-497a-8fd7-170fe69fc16d">将我们包围</text><text for="line-1a2b5f63-68d6-47fa-9af9-56e1184cb59c">听到传来了的声音</text><text for="line-25a568f2-1c24-4a77-9e02-03d985dc64b3">活下去</text><text for="line-fb569a20-fcce-48a2-a3ee-2c821904c5d3">就算丑陋不堪也要活下去</text><text for="line-c5427cdd-bcfb-4f44-a51b-6c73a925fa4c">活下去才能守护</text><text for="line-7b99fc11-c713-4414-b83d-b2426bbeb899">就算丑陋不堪也要活下去</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="06:41.055"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-062c60ff-1470-412a-8763-7aee987c7322" itunes:key="line-062c60ff-1470-412a-8763-7aee987c7322" begin="00:56.977" end="01:02.530" ttm:agent="riya"><span begin="00:56.977" end="00:57.490" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">足</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:56.977" end="00:57.157">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:57.157" end="00:57.490">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:58.450" end="00:58.830">さ</span><span begin="00:58.830" end="00:59.020">え</span><span begin="01:00.216" end="01:00.716" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">竦</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:00.216" end="01:00.476">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:00.476" end="01:00.716">く</span></span></span><span begin="01:00.716" end="01:01.020">む</span><span begin="01:01.987" end="01:02.147">よ</span><span begin="01:02.147" end="01:02.247">う</span><span begin="01:02.247" end="01:02.530">な</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-015a9586-f74a-470f-aba7-2e6614b03577" itunes:key="line-015a9586-f74a-470f-aba7-2e6614b03577" begin="01:04.007" end="01:06.110" ttm:agent="riya"><span begin="01:04.007" end="01:04.447" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">断</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.007" end="01:0